# Camera shot presets are reusable additive shot shapes.

# Camera blend assets define distance blends and easing for shot presets.

# Cinematic shot accents are additive over the base camera rail.
# GO hands off to the normal course camera keys. Keep these authored poses
# inactive so neither the close-up nor its overlapping rear view takes over.
# The first grounded battery keeps the normal combat view. These overlapping
# sample portraits used to zoom in twice and jump on priority handoffs.

